  "blocks": {
    "\"It keeps writing the v3 SDK syntax — we're on v5.\"": "“它一直在写 v3 SDK 的语法——我们已经用 v5 了。”",
    "\"v5 shipped after the knowledge cutoff. Load the v5 changelog as contextual knowledge, otherwise it'll keep fabricating from the older parametric version.\"": "“v5 发布于知识截止时间之后。把 v5 的更新日志作为上下文知识加载进来，否则它会继续依据较旧的参数化版本进行编造。”",
    "The cutoff exists because of how models are made: training bakes a snapshot of text into the model's parameters, and after that the parameters are frozen. The model doesn't know its knowledge has an edge — asked about something past the cutoff, it doesn't refuse, it extrapolates from the nearest thing it does know. That's what makes the trap quiet: code written against an old version of a library looks plausible, often compiles, and fails on the parts that changed.": "知识截止时间源于模型的制造方式：<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/training\">训练</a>会把某个时间点的文本快照固化进模型的<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/parameters\">参数</a>，之后参数便被冻结。模型并不知道自己的知识存在边界——当你询问截止时间之后的事物时，它不会拒绝，而会根据自己知道的最相近内容进行外推。这正是陷阱隐蔽之处：针对旧版库写出的代码看起来很可信，往往也能编译，却会在发生变化的部分出错。",
    "The date past which a model has no parametric knowledge. Libraries, APIs, and events from after the cutoff are fabrication traps unless their docs are loaded as contextual knowledge. Each model release ships with its own cutoff.": "知识截止时间是这样一个日期：超过它之后，<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/model\">模型</a>就不再具有<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/parametric-knowledge\">参数化知识</a>。截止时间之后出现的库、API 和事件，如果没有把相关文档作为<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/contextual-knowledge\">上下文知识</a>加载进来，就很容易诱发编造。每个模型版本都有自己的知识截止时间。",
    "The fix is always the same: get current information into context. Load the changelog, point at the installed version's type definitions, or have the agent read the docs from the web. Anything in context outranks nothing-in-parameters.": "解决办法始终相同：把最新信息放入<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/context\">上下文</a>。加载更新日志，指向已安装版本的类型定义，或让<a href=\"/ai-coding-dictionary/agent\">智能体</a>从网页读取文档。上下文中真实存在的信息，永远优先于参数中根本不存在的知识。",
    "Usage:": "<em>用法：</em>"
  },
